  "geometry_definition": "Ankle distance, left/right internal knee cosines, shoulder width, midpoint shoulders minus hips signed x and hips minus shoulders signed y. Euclidean distances/offsets are normalized by each measured box height. Cosine requires both projected segment lengths >1e-6 box heights. All constituent joints finite with confidence>=0.20 and box height>1. No 3D or heading inference from images.",
